{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22161","headline":"归田三首 一 · 白居易","name":"归田三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人生何所欲，所欲唯两端。\n中人爱富贵，高士慕神仙。\n神仙须有籍，富贵亦在天。\n莫恋长安道，莫寻方丈山。\n西京尘浩浩，东海浪漫漫。\n金门不可入，琪树何由攀。\n不如归山下，如法种春田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22161.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22161","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}